# Web performance

When optimizing or building features in apps or `@repo/ui`:

1. `.agents/skills/vercel-react-best-practices/SKILL.md` — React/Next patterns
2. `.agents/skills/performance/SKILL.md` — Lighthouse, loading strategy
3. `.agents/skills/core-web-vitals/SKILL.md` — LCP, INP, CLS
4. Motion: `.agents/skills/fixing-motion-performance/SKILL.md`

After changes, do not wait to be asked: Playwright MCP (light/dark) if the UI changed, then `pnpm verify`.
